abstract: >-
  An end-to-end system for predicting professional Counter-Strike 2 match
  outcomes and calibrating the resulting probabilities, including Elo and
  map-level ratings, veto simulation, feature-attribution analysis, and a
  reproducible evaluation pipeline.
keywords:
  - esports
  - Counter-Strike 2
  - win probability
  - Elo rating
  - calibration
  - reproducibility
